 "call_id": "toolu_013p4FaYAkmeL4nZxBH19bxx", "tool": "list_payments", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 28310, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_013p4FaYAkmeL4nZxBH19bxx", "tool": "list_payments", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 28310, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_013p4FaYAkmeL4nZxBH19bxx", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 32836, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I paid Evergreen Catering's approved invoice once, by ACH, because wire payments weren't available.\n\n**Payment:**\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Invoice:** INV-72332 (Evergreen Catering, vendor V-092)\n- **Amount:** $5,944.47, the full invoice amount\n- **Method:** ACH from the operating account\n- **Status:** Sent\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Which invoice:** Evergreen Catering has three invoices, and INV-72332 is the only approved one. INV-19699 was already paid, and INV-18683 is still a draft waiting for approval, so I didn't touch either.\n- **Approval:** The amount is under the $10,000 limit, so it didn't need controller approval.\n- **Wire attempt:** The wire service returned \"503 Service Unavailable\" even after automatic retries, and no wire was sent.\n- **No double payment:** Before switching to ACH, I checked that no payment existed. I also sent the ACH with a key that stops it from running twice. Afterwards, the payment list showed only PAY0001.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01W7NZo5nvyEDXZrBssprMEi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Evergreen Catering"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_017S8FFMauCXFyghDjTKtBkx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_u